      "comment": "DYNAMITE ERIC (1) has missed the frame at his last couple of starts but just a few runs back broke the clock when winning over 410m at this track, taking a Restricted WIN in a superb 23.18. Can return to winning form here if runs up to best figures. PAW VINE (7) is better than last start when fifth (27.93) in a Grade 5 H at this track over 485m. Key runner on best form. STAR REBEL (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 10 lengths at Geelong in a handy 22.57 beating Paw Judd. Awkwardly drawn but has a good record over this journey. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has definite claims. MISS SPARKLES (8) will give backers a sight.",
